{"tier":"glm-5.2","verse":9,"ref":"2-kings 10:9","book":"2-kings","lang":"yo","chapter":10,"translation":"Ó sì wáyé ní àárọ̀, tí ó jáde, ó sì dúró, ó sì sọ fún gbogbo ènìyàn náà, Ẹ̀yin ni ènìyàn olóòtítọ́; wòrà, èmi ni mo ṣe ìjàpọn pẹ̀lú olúwa mi, mo sì pa á, ṣùgbọ́n ta ni ó lu ⟨את⟩ gbogbo àwọn wọ̀nyí?","tokens":[{"surface":"ויהי","gloss":"Ó sì wáyé"},{"surface":"בבקר","gloss":"ní àárọ̀"},{"surface":"ויצא","gloss":"tó jáde"},{"surface":"ויעמד","gloss":"ó sì dúró"},{"surface":"ויאמר","gloss":"ó sì sọ"},{"surface":"אל","gloss":"fún"},{"surface":"כל","gloss":"gbogbo"},{"surface":"העם","gloss":"ènìyàn náà"},{"surface":"צדקים","gloss":"ènìyàn olóòtítọ́"},{"surface":"אתם","gloss":"ẹ̀yin"},{"surface":"הנה","gloss":"wòrà"},{"surface":"אני","gloss":"èmi"},{"surface":"קשרתי","gloss":"mo ṣe ìjàpọn"},{"surface":"על","gloss":"pẹ̀lú"},{"surface":"אדני","gloss":"olúwa mi"},{"surface":"ואהרגהו","gloss":"mo sì pa á"},{"surface":"ומי","gloss":"ṣùgbọ́n ta ni"},{"surface":"הכה","gloss":"ó lu"},{"surface":"את","gloss":"⟨את⟩","marks":"gbogbo àwọn wọ̀nyí"},{"surface":"כל","gloss":"gbogbo"},{"surface":"אלה","gloss":"àwọn wọ̀nyí"}],"timestamp":"2026-08-23T06:40:09.012013538Z","model":"glm-5.3"}